\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces CP-aligned probe score trajectories. Each panel averages all test traces for one model, with step 0 at the true commitment point. HS probes (blue, solid) show a sharper score increase at CP than text probes (orange, dashed), with OT-7B showing the strongest separation and R1-32B the weakest, consistent with the evidence gradient. Shaded bands: $\pm $1 std. Points with $<$5 traces are omitted.}}{8}{figure.caption.23}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:trajectory}{{6}{8}{CP-aligned probe score trajectories. Each panel averages all test traces for one model, with step 0 at the true commitment point. HS probes (blue, solid) show a sharper score increase at CP than text probes (orange, dashed), with OT-7B showing the strongest separation and R1-32B the weakest, consistent with the evidence gradient. Shaded bands: $\pm $1 std. Points with $<$5 traces are omitted}{figure.caption.23}{}}
